/E (It is our privilege to welcome you to SOD X BITSMUN 2026, a conference born from the union of two institutions that have each, in their own right, built a reputation for rigorous debate and diplomatic excellence. This year, SODMUN and BITSMUN come together not merely as co-hosts, but as collaborators in reimagining what a Model United Nations experience can be.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
