/E (Behind every committee session, every crisis update, and every gavel fall stands a Secretariat that has worked to ensure this conference runs with precision and purpose. We have built this edition on three commitments: substantive depth in every agenda, procedural fairness in every committee, and an environment where delegates, whether stepping into their first conference or their tenth, are pushed to think harder and argue better.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
