/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 74 0 R
/T (Summit of Diplomacy Model United Nations \(SODMUN\) is a teen-led Model United Nations conference hosted in Dubai. Since its first conference in 2024, it has grown from 200 delegates to over 750 at its fourth conference, with more than 2,000 delegates across all editions. It's the largest private teen-led MUN conference in the world, built and run entirely by teenagers. Past editions have converted that growth into real-world impact, raising over 13 lakhs INR to bring solar energy to rural schools. Now, we're bringing SODMUN to India.)
/E (Summit of Diplomacy Model United Nations \(SODMUN\) is a teen-led Model United Nations conference hosted in Dubai. Since its first conference in 2024, it has grown from 200 delegates to over 750 at its fourth conference, with more than 2,000 delegates across all editions. It's the largest private teen-led MUN conference in the world, built and run entirely by teenagers. Past editions have converted that growth into real-world impact, raising over 13 lakhs INR to bring solar energy to rural schools. Now, we're bringing SODMUN to India.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 74 0 R
/T (BITS Model United Nations \(BITSMUN\) is a premier collegiate Model United Nations conference hosted in Pilani, Rajasthan. Since its first edition in 2009, it has grown into one of the longest-running and most anticipated MUNs in India, consistently welcoming over 400 delegates per edition, with thousands of participants across its history. It stands as one of the largest student-run MUN conferences in the country, built and organized entirely by the students of BITS Pilani. Past editions have converted that legacy into true global dialogue, hosting delegates from over ten nations to foster diplomacy, negotiation, and critical thinking that transcends borders.)
/E (BITS Model United Nations \(BITSMUN\) is a premier collegiate Model United Nations conference hosted in Pilani, Rajasthan. Since its first edition in 2009, it has grown into one of the longest-running and most anticipated MUNs in India, consistently welcoming over 400 delegates per edition, with thousands of participants across its history. It stands as one of the largest student-run MUN conferences in the country, built and organized entirely by the students of BITS Pilani. Past editions have converted that legacy into true global dialogue, hosting delegates from over ten nations to foster diplomacy, negotiation, and critical thinking that transcends borders.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
