/Title (Summit of Diplomacy Model United Nations \(SODMUN\) is a teen-led Model United Nations conference hosted in Dubai. Since its first conference in 2024, it has grown from 200 delegates to over 750 at its fourth conference, with more than 2,000 delegates across all editions. It's the largest private teen-led MUN conference in the world, built and run entirely by teenagers. Past editions have converted that growth into real-world impact, raising over 13 lakhs INR to bring solar energy to rural schools. Now, we're bringing SODMUN to India.)
