709 0 obj
<<
/Title (BITS Model United Nations \(BITSMUN\) is a premier collegiate Model United Nations conference hosted in Pilani, Rajasthan. Since its first edition in 2009, it has grown into one of the longest-running and most anticipated MUNs in India, consistently welcoming over 400 delegates per edition, with thousands of participants across its history. It stands as one of the largest student-run MUN conferences in the country, built and organized entirely by the students of BITS Pilani. Past editions have converted that legacy into true global dialogue, hosting delegates from over ten nations to foster diplomacy, negotiation, and critical thinking that transcends borders.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 604 0 R
/Next 800 0 R
